# does not overwrite UPSTREAM), paste the lines in, then
# `go generate ./internal/secassess/cvss4` and re-run the oracle tests
# (docs/code-security.md "CVSS 4.0 base scores on findings"). A new commit is a deliberate
# act: read the diff of cvss_score.js first; the generator's anchors fail
# when a rule the Go scorer reproduces has changed.
